<title>FRANCE: Gilbert Dupont boosts rating on Air Liquide.</title>
<headline>Gilbert Dupont boosts rating on Air Liquide.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokerage Gilbert Dupont raised its rating on the stock of Air Liquide to '3', or buy, from '2', and forecast a resumption of profit growth for the group in 1997, portfolio managers said on Monday.</p>
<p>Air Liquide shares were up 1.7 percent at 835 francs at 1010 GMT, in line with the CAC-40 index.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
